**.subckt top_fc_power_tb
C1 voutn VSSA 20p
C2 voutp VSSA 20p
V1 VDDA VSSA VDDA
V3 VSSA 0 0
V4 Balance_Level VSSA Balance_Level
I0 Iref VSSA 1u
Bvinp Vinp VSSA V = {VCM + V(Vdiff)/2}
Bvinn Vinn VSSA V = {VCM - V(Vdiff)/2}
Vdiff Vdiff VSSA 0
x1 VDDA_BIAS VDDA_OTA VDDA_CMFB Balance_Level Vinp voutp voutn Vinn Iref VSSA top_fc_power
Vamm1 VDDA VDDA_OTA 0
.save i(vamm1)
Vamm2 VDDA VDDA_CMFB 0
.save i(vamm2)
Vamm3 VDDA VDDA_BIAS 0
.save i(vamm3)
**** begin user architecture code

